    "text": "Kait 8\nwebsite\nOsceola\nOsceola celebrates 150th anniversary with birthday party\nBy Jake Tester,\n2 hours agoOSCEOLA, Ark. (KAIT) - Osceola marked 150 years of being an incorporated town on Wednesday, and what better way to celebrate than with a birthday party?. Food trucks, live music, inflatables, guest speakers, and more descended on the downtown courthouse lawn. The party ended with a spectacular drone show. Mayor...\n1",
